// Regular expressions over joined sources: replaceRegex on both sides of join.on, a parameter pattern and a
// negated match in where, capture groups by a literal number and by a parameter, an extracted number read
// with tryAsInteger, coalesce over a missing match, and a replacement taken from a field.
{
  "from": { "entity": "order_items" },
  "joins": [
    {
      "kind": "inner",
      "entity": "products",
      "on": {
        "operator": "equal",
        "type": { "name": "boolean" },
        "left": {
          "operator": "replaceRegex",
          "type": { "name": "string" },
          "operand": {
            "operator": "asString",
            "type": { "name": "string" },
            "operand": { "source": "order_items", "field": "product_id", "type": { "name": "uuid" } }
          },
          "pattern": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": "-" },
          "replacement": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": "" }
        },
        "right": {
          "operator": "replaceRegex",
          "type": { "name": "string" },
          "operand": {
            "operator": "lower",
            "type": { "name": "string" },
            "operand": { "source": "products", "field": "sku", "type": { "name": "string" } }
          },
          "pattern": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": "[^0-9a-f]" },
          "replacement": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": "" }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "where": {
    "operator": "and",
    "type": { "name": "boolean" },
    "conditions": [
      {
        "operator": "matchesRegex",
        "type": { "name": "boolean" },
        "operand": { "source": "products", "field": "sku", "type": { "name": "string" } },
        "pattern": { "param": "sku_pattern", "type": { "name": "string" } }
      },
      {
        "operator": "not",
        "type": { "name": "boolean" },
        "condition": {
          "operator": "matchesRegex",
          "type": { "name": "boolean" },
          "operand": {
            "source": "products",
            "field": "description",
            "type": { "name": "string", "nullable": true }
          },
          "pattern": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": "\\b(?:discontinued|recalled)\\b" }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "select": [
    { "alias": "id", "expression": { "source": "order_items", "field": "id", "type": { "name": "uuid" } } },
    {
      "alias": "sku_series",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "extractRegex",
        "type": { "name": "string", "nullable": true },
        "operand": { "source": "products", "field": "sku", "type": { "name": "string" } },
        "pattern": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": "^([A-Z]+)-([0-9]+)" },
        "group": { "type": { "name": "integer" }, "value": 1 }
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "sku_number",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "tryAsInteger",
        "type": { "name": "integer", "nullable": true },
        "operand": {
          "operator": "extractRegex",
          "type": { "name": "string", "nullable": true },
          "operand": { "source": "products", "field": "sku", "type": { "name": "string" } },
          "pattern": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": "^([A-Z]+)-([0-9]+)" },
          "group": { "type": { "name": "integer" }, "value": 2 }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "chosen_group",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "extractRegex",
        "type": { "name": "string", "nullable": true },
        "operand": { "source": "products", "field": "sku", "type": { "name": "string" } },
        "pattern": { "param": "sku_pattern", "type": { "name": "string" } },
        "group": { "param": "sku_group", "type": { "name": "integer" } }
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "first_word_of_description",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "extractRegex",
        "type": { "name": "string", "nullable": true },
        "operand": {
          "source": "products",
          "field": "description",
          "type": { "name": "string", "nullable": true }
        },
        "pattern": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": "\\w+" }
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "sku_or_placeholder",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "coalesce",
        "type": { "name": "string" },
        "values": [
          {
            "operator": "extractRegex",
            "type": { "name": "string", "nullable": true },
            "operand": { "source": "products", "field": "sku", "type": { "name": "string" } },
            "pattern": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": "[0-9]{4,}" }
          },
          { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": "n/a" }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "replacement_from_a_field",
      "expression": {
        "operator": "replaceRegex",
        "type": { "name": "string" },
        "operand": { "source": "products", "field": "sku", "type": { "name": "string" } },
        "pattern": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": "^[A-Z]+" },
        "replacement": {
          "operator": "asString",
          "type": { "name": "string" },
          "operand": { "source": "order_items", "field": "quantity", "type": { "name": "integer" } }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "orderBy": [
    {
      "expression": {
        "operator": "extractRegex",
        "type": { "name": "string", "nullable": true },
        "operand": { "source": "products", "field": "sku", "type": { "name": "string" } },
        "pattern": { "type": { "name": "string" }, "value": "[0-9]+" }
      }
    },
    { "expression": { "source": "order_items", "field": "id", "type": { "name": "uuid" } } }
  ]
}
